{"type":"system","subtype":"task_notification","task_id":"bpfuc7jjd","tool_use_id":"toolu_019iu6qCjzhyiaSpo2W3DKHV","status":"completed","output_file":"/tmp/claude-441489/-scratch-users-kushinm-auto-psych-outer-loop-live-runs-run1-repo/32ce0bda-503e-4f12-9430-c09debe5d0a9/tasks/bpfuc7jjd.output","summary":"Background command \"cd /scratch/users/kushinm/auto-psych/outer_loop_live/run1/data/subjective_randomness/experiment3/model_loop; D=iter_4/candidate_2\ncat > $D/hypothesis.md <<'EOF'\nSpotting that a sequence was deliberately constructed is an all-or-none event, not a graded impression: on each trial a person either notices that a sequence is designed (an end streak, a palindrome, an antisymmetric layout, monotone run lengths, a lopsided stretch — the more of this structure, the likelier the notice) or does not, and a sequence caught as designed is rejected by a fixed extra amount on top of the graded comparison of how random the two look (personal ideal switching rate and sensitivity with lenience toward over-alternation, personal weights on imbalance and the longest streak, shared weights on the structural cues, and a personal guessing rate). How readily a person makes that categorical call is their own detection threshold, drawn from a population, so low-threshold people decisively reject anything structured while high-threshold people never do — predicting that people's agreement with the majority varies more than graded weights produce, concentrated on pairs where exactly one sequence is structured.\nEOF\necho categorical_design_detection > $D/model_name.txt\npython3 - <<'PY'\nsrc=open('models/personal_pattern_detection_gain.py').read()\nD='iter_4/candidate_2/'\nhead,body=src.split('with pm.Model() as model:',1)\ndoc='''\"\"\"Categorical design detection.\n\nSpotting that a sequence was deliberately constructed is an all-or-none event:\non each trial a person either notices that a sequence is designed (the more\nstructural cues - end streak, palindrome, antisymmetry, monotone run lengths,\nlopsided stretch - the likelier) or not, and a sequence caught as designed is\nrejected by a fixed extra amount on top of the graded comparison of how random\nthe two look (personal ideal switching rate and sensitivity with lenience toward\nover-alternation, personal weights on imbalance and the longest run, shared\nweights on structural cues, personal guessing rate). Each person has their own\ndetection threshold drawn from a population.\n\"\"\"\n'''\nhead=doc+head[head.index('\\nimport numpy'):]\nbody=body.replace('''    # Personal pattern-detection gain scaling all structural cues (median 1).\n    sigma_gain = pm.HalfNormal(\"sigma_gain\", sigma=0.7)\n    z_gain = pm.Normal(\"z_gain\", mu=0.0, sigma=1.0, shape=MAX_PARTICIPANTS)\n    gain = pm.math.exp(sigma_gain * z_gain)\n''','''    # Personal threshold for the categorical \"designed\" verdict (logit scale).\n    mu_thr = pm.Normal(\"mu_thr\", mu=-1.5, sigma=1.0)\n    sigma_thr = pm.HalfNormal(\"sigma_thr\", sigma=1.0)\n    z_thr = pm.Normal(\"z_thr\", mu=0.0, sigma=1.0, shape=MAX_PARTICIPANTS)\n    thr = mu_thr + sigma_thr * z_thr\n    # Shared scale of structure salience on the detection logit.\n    det_scale = pm.LogNormal(\"det_scale\", mu=0.0, sigma=0.5)\n    # Shared extra rejection of a sequence caught as designed.\n    reject = pm.HalfNormal(\"reject\", sigma=2.0)\n''')\nbody=body.replace('''    s = gain[participant_id]\n''','''    t = thr[participant_id]\n''')\nold=body[body.index('    score_a ='):body.index('    lam = lapse')]\nnew='''    st_a = structure(endrun_a, palin_a, variety_a, lopsided_a, antisym_a)\n    st_b = structure(endrun_b, palin_b, variety_b, lopsided_b, antisym_b)\n    score_a = -b * rate_penalty(alt_rate_a) - g * imbalance_a - d * maxrun_a + st_a\n    score_b = -b * rate_penalty(alt_rate_b) - g * imbalance_b - d * maxrun_b + st_b\n    diff = score_a - score_b\n    # Probability each sequence is caught as designed (less structure term = more design).\n    q_a = pm.math.sigmoid(t - det_scale * st_a)\n    q_b = pm.math.sigmoid(t - det_scale * st_b)\n    same = q_a * q_b + (1.0 - q_a) * (1.0 - q_b)\n    p_engaged = (\n        same * pm.math.sigmoid(diff)\n        + (1.0 - q_a) * q_b * pm.math.sigmoid(diff + reject)\n        + q_a * (1.0 - q_b) * pm.math.sigmoid(diff - reject)\n    )\n'''\nbody=body.replace(old,new)\nopen(D+'candidate.py','w').write(head+'with pm.Model() as model:'+body)\nPY\ngrep -n \"gain\\|s \\* \" $D/candidate.py\ncd /scratch/users/kushinm/auto-psych/outer_loop_live/runs/run1/repo && time /scratch/users/kushinm/auto-psych/outer_loop_live/venv/bin/python -m src.pipelines.inner_loop.check_candidate --candidate-dir /scratch/users/kushinm/auto-psych/outer_loop_live/run1/data/subjective_randomness/experiment3/model_loop/iter_4/candidate_2 --responses /scratch/users/kushinm/auto-psych/outer_loop_live/run1/data/subjective_randomness/experiment3/model_loop/responses.csv 2>&1 | tail -5\" completed (exit code 0)","uuid":"5e82f7ee-db8a-48ac-ac22-02ac1f3a04df","session_id":"32ce0bda-503e-4f12-9430-c09debe5d0a9"}
